        Smart Contracts Formal Verification: A Systematic Literature Review
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Davila%2C+R">Rene Davila</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Barcenas%2C+E">Everardo Barcenas</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Aldeco-Perez%2C+R">Rocio Aldeco-Perez</a>
      
