        The 3rd Place Solution of CCIR CUP 2025: A Framework for <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> Generation in Multi-Turn Legal Conversation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
