        Build Your Personalized Research Group: A Multiagent Framework for Continual and Interactive Science Automation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+E">Ed Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ren%2C+J">Junyu Ren</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pan%2C+X">Xintian Pan</a>, 
      
